  <language>en_US</language>
  <keyword>odeprint</keyword>
  <short_description>Command-window ODE output function.</short_description>
  <syntax>
    <syntax_item>status = odeprint(t, y, flag)</syntax_item>
  </syntax>
  <description>
    <p>
      <b>odeprint</b> is an output callback for ODE solvers. It prints accepted output points and returns <b>0</b> to continue integration.</p>
    <table style="width:100%">
  <tr><th>Flag</th><th>When called</th><th>Return value</th></tr>
  <tr><td><b>'init'</b></td><td>Before integration output starts.</td><td><b>0</b> or <b>false</b> to continue.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>''</b></td><td>At accepted output points.</td><td><b>0</b> or <b>false</b> to continue; <b>1</b> or <b>true</b> stops integration.</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>'done'</b></td><td>After integration finishes.</td><td>Return value is ignored.</td></tr>
</table>
  </description>
